# Home Base UI

- Primary viewport is still iPhone Safari over VPN; also keep desktop readable (wider max widths, clear contrast).
- Bottom tabs: Apps · Shell · Files · Cursor · Logs · Alerts.
- Shell = interactive PTY + session attach (former Mon). Logs = capped console ring (300).
- Workspace pickers and Run stacks use native `<select>` dropdowns (`hb-select`).
- Ship actions are hold-to-confirm; Run/Stop is a toggle from port/session state.
- Pull-to-refresh is global (top-of-scroll drag).
- Visual system: dark graphite + teal accent (`--color-accent`), Syne + IBM Plex Mono. Avoid purple gradients and cream/serif clichés.
- Shell tab must remain usable with on-screen Ctrl/Esc helpers.
- Cursor tab streams markdown; show project cwd and agent id.
